{"id":"wb-3-123","name":"广允缅寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"广允缅寺","text":"广允缅寺位于云南省临沧市沧源佤族自治县勐董镇网鹅村，为南传上座部佛教庙宇。1988年，列入第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n广允缅寺大殿建于清代，由重檐亭阁与回廊殿堂组合。亭阁为过殿，檐下施斗栱，两重檐之间转角处加建两重假檐，使阁两侧如五重檐。佛殿通面阔13.5米，通进深23.2米，平面呈纵向布局；穿斗式构架，三重檐歇山顶；梁枋皆木雕彩绘。殿内壁画十幅，其内容为佛本生故事及土司出巡。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%BF%E5%85%81%E7%BC%85%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94414006,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94414006","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/25f7dd65ece2cbf5251963b9.jpg","title":"广允缅寺_-_主殿_-_2024-10-15.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B9%BF%E5%85%81%E7%BC%85%E5%AF%BA_-_%E4%B8%BB%E6%AE%BF_-_2024-10-15.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7c/%E5%B9%BF%E5%85%81%E7%BC%85%E5%AF%BA_-_%E4%B8%BB%E6%AE%BF_-_2024-10-15.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"瑞丽江的河水","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​广允缅寺主殿","width":320,"height":240}}